license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  MTW NetLoopScheduler is a header-only cooperative scheduler for AVR
  microcontrollers, based on MTW TinyLoopScheduler, with procedural
  native-UART shared-variable synchronization, static memory,
  VALUE-only SUM8 and per-variable acknowledgements.
keywords:
  - Arduino
  - AVR
  - embedded systems
  - cooperative scheduling
  - shared variables
  - UART
  - static memory
